Mario Paint (Shroom, .sho) songs for tests/m3/shroom_decode.sh (bbmp_shroom module, I710aa). Never committed: fetched by sha256 into the git-ignored
tests/m3/fixtures/.cache. No redistribution licence is stated for the songs (Modland archive). The instrument sounds (Mariopants 1.1 data/notes.wav,
Nintendo data) are never fetched or committed: the playback part reads the path in env SELECTA_SHROOM_SAMPLES and skips (exit 77) without it.
